// Cinderdeep Mine layout (WP-062): greybox blocks (scaled `block_unit`, centered on `pos`). The
// tunnel's walls are the terrain (terrain.ron), so the blocks here are the furniture: timber
// supports, the forge, pillars, and the sealed wall's frame. Y is up. Places (x, z):
//   mouth hall       (  0, -85)   timber frame at the Verge mouth
//   teaching room    (  0, -64)   the ride cart waits at its north end (3, -48)
//   the gallery      (  0,   4)   three timber frames; the rail runs at x = 3
//   lower hall       (  0,  76)   L10 at (0, 68); four pillars; the push cart's rail on z = 78
//   west branch      (-45,  78)   the sealed wall at x -35..-33; the smoltorch chamber behind
//   the forge        ( 61,  73)   B08's arena, x 44..78, z 54..92; fog gate at x = 44
// Walks between Lanterns are checked by world_state/hollowdeep_tests.rs.
(
  landmarks: [
    // --- The Verge mouth: a timber frame over the way in ----------------------------------------
    (name: "mouth_post_w", kit: "block_unit", pos: (-4.60, 2.50, -88.00), scale: (0.80, 5.00, 0.80)),
    (name: "mouth_post_e", kit: "block_unit", pos: (4.60, 2.50, -88.00), scale: (0.80, 5.00, 0.80)),
    (name: "mouth_beam", kit: "block_unit", pos: (0.00, 5.40, -88.00), scale: (10.00, 0.80, 1.00)),
